* SPICE Netlist
* Voltage Source
Vx 1 g.b V

* Resistors
R1 5 2 gm*(1+eta)
R2 2 7 gm*(1+phi)/GL
R3 6 4 (a+eta)*nx*vx
R4 4 3 go
R5 4 3 GL

* Current Source
I1 6 6 DC (a+eta)*nx*vx

* Node Mapping
* 1: positive terminal of Vx
* 2: node between R1 and R2
* 3: common node for R4 and R5
* 4: node connecting R3, R4 and R5
* 5: negative terminal of R1
* 6: current source node
* 7: negative terminal of R2
* g.b: common ground